[gd_scene load_steps=24 format=3]

; M3-BPR-01: the derelict's main deck (Ch4: the sail leeches, the bottle hermit, the Spar-Wraith and the derelict
; randoms), greybox until env-art's kit lands (M3-ENV-06). Grade from docs/kb/art/color_script.md "Ch4": key #FFB16E
; lamp 1.2 (the Sun node is the lamp key), fill #2A4A6E 0.2, rim #9DB4D9 0.5, sky #0B1630 / #1E2E4E, fog #22354F,
; exposure 1.10, saturation x0.95; the sea is night_sea (#061A2B) with sea-glow 0.12. A planked deck at y = 0 along the
; battle axis, the mainmast and foremast behind the fighters with their yards and set sails above the frame's
; middle, the far bulwark behind the foes, no near rail (nothing between the camera and the fighters), two hanging
; deck lamps, and the ferry's lamps far off on the strait.

